        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-38" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Bei einer 1-10 passiert nichts Außergewöhnliches (nur Kälte und Marsch), bei einer 11-20 tritt ein Ereignis aus der Tabelle ein." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="560" x="1920" y="5310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-40" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Sobald die Gruppe die &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;200 Meilen&lt;/b&gt; zurückgelegt hat, beginnt die aktive Suche. Jeden Tag muss ein Charakter (der Kundschafter) eine Probe auf &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;140&quot;&gt;Weisheit (Überlebenskunst) gegen DC 15&lt;/b&gt; ablegen:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Fehlschlag:&lt;/b&gt; Keine Spur von Salsvault. Die Suche geht am nächsten Tag weiter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Erfolg (15–19):&lt;/b&gt; Der Kundschafter findet die Spur eines &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot;&gt;Eismephiten&lt;/b&gt;. Nach weiteren &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;82&quot;&gt;1d4 Stunden&lt;/b&gt; führt diese Spur direkt zur Ruine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Großer Erfolg (20+):&lt;/b&gt; Die Gruppe findet &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;39&quot;&gt;Salsvault sofort&lt;/b&gt;, ohne den Umweg über die Mephiten-Spur.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="560" x="1920" y="5410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-41" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="SalsValut Eingangg" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1800" y="6770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-42" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Durch peitschenden Schnee und bittere Kälte bemerkt ihr ein halb versunkenes Gebäude aus dunkelblauem Stein, das aus dem Eis hervorragt. Eine graue Steintür ist so gemeißelt, dass sie wie ein Gesicht mit einem halb freigelegten Schädel aussieht. Über der Tür ist das Wort &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;273&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;‚SALSVAULT‘&lt;/b&gt; eingraviert&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="1930" y="6860" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-43" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Der Eingang zu Salsvault&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1. Die Wächter: &lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Ziro und Glacies&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Kreaturen:&lt;/b&gt; Zwei &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Eismephite&lt;/b&gt; verstecken sich in der Nähe des Eingangs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Entdeckung:&lt;/b&gt; Charaktere mit einer &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;passiven Wahrnehmung von 13&lt;/font&gt; oder höher&lt;/b&gt; bemerken sie.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Verhalten:&lt;/b&gt; * Wenn die Spieler mit ihnen interagieren, greifen sie sofort an.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Werden sie nicht bemerkt, schleichen sie der Gruppe heimlich in die Ruine nach (angelockt durch die Energie des Frostleids).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Gefahr:&lt;/b&gt; Sobald die Gruppe einen Raum mit Frostleid-Phiolen erreicht, versuchen die Mephite, diese zu zerbrechen, um die magische Kälte freizusetzen.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;2. Das versiegelte Tor&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Zustand:&lt;/b&gt; Die Tür ist festgefroren.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Öffnen:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;Stärke-Check (DC 15):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Die Tür wird mit roher Gewalt aufgedrückt.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Schaden (10 HP):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Das Eis kann mit Wuchtschaden (bludgeoning) oder Feuerschaden zerstört werden.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Konsequenz bei Lärm:&lt;/b&gt; Wenn das Eis mit &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;38&quot;&gt;Wuchtschaden&lt;/b&gt; (z.B. Hammer) zertrümmert wird, alarmiert das Geräusch &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;106&quot;&gt;zwei belebte Rüstungen (animated armors)&lt;/b&gt; aus Raum S3. Diese warten dann in Raum S1 auf die Charaktere und greifen sofort an.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="490" width="560" x="1920" y="6980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-44" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1790" y="7530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-45" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Die Empfangshalle&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;1. Die Inschrift&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sprache:&lt;/b&gt; Archaisches &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Draconisch&lt;/b&gt; (eine uralte Form aus Aeor).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Entzifferung:&lt;/b&gt; Charaktere, die Draconisch sprechen, benötigen ein paar Minuten Studium; alternativ hilft der Zauber &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;115&quot;&gt;Comprehend Languages&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inhalt:&lt;/b&gt; &amp;gt; „Willkommen in Salsvault! Besucher warten hier bitte auf eine Eskorte und &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;84&quot;&gt;BERÜHREN NICHTS OHNE ERLAUBNIS&lt;/b&gt;.“&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;2. Die Gefahr (Lärm)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vorsicht:&lt;/b&gt; Wenn die Charaktere lauter als ein Flüstern sprechen oder Lärm machen, kommen die &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;92&quot;&gt;belebten Rüstungen (Animated Armors)&lt;/b&gt; aus Raum S3 sofort herbei, um nach dem Rechten zu sehen.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;3. Die Türen&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tür nach S4:&lt;/b&gt; Diese Tür ist fest verschlossen (Lock-Mechanismus von Salsvault).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tür nach S2:&lt;/b&gt; Diese Tür steht &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;leicht offen&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Untersuchung (DC 10 Intelligenz/Nachforschung):&lt;/b&gt; Ein Charakter bemerkt, dass die Tür vor kurzem gewaltsam aufgebrochen wurde (das waren Urgon und Orvo bei ihrem Besuch).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="440" width="560" x="1960" y="7570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.dndbeyond.com/compendium-images/egtw/yDOyqyOocErRgYJK/5.10-salsvault.png&quot;&gt;" link="&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.dndbeyond.com/compendium-images/egtw/yDOyqyOocErRgYJK/5.10-salsvault.png&quot;&gt;" id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-46">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="40" width="30" x="2760" y="5850" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultCeilings&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;1f7f5513-917c-4f96-b18f-0bd34ae0a73e&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Ceilings&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;a0db08a3-351f-4fec-a5d7-97061e04c03c&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;The ceilings in Salsvault’s rooms are 10 feet high, with 8-foot-high doorways connecting them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultChests&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;86f954ef-65cf-4f2e-9d5d-953533cef70f&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultChests&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;f99c74fb-ecda-497c-b639-1a43c410b190&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Chests&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;ca100999-e9d8-471c-a58a-de0926f12934&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Stone chests two feet on each side are built into the floors in several areas. A&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover spell-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-detect-magic&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(112, 76, 217); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;detect magic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;spell reveals a faint aura of abjuration magic radiating from each chest. A chest has AC 17; 27 hit points; resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage; and immunity to poison and psychic damage.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;50691097-6502-42bc-962d-445e05e7f733&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;If an area’s description notes a locked chest, the chest’s lock can be picked with a successful DC 15 Dexterity check using thieves’ tools or forced open with a successful DC 18 Strength check.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-ferol-sal&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(188, 15, 15); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;Ferol Sal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#S17FerolsLaboratory&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;5c809e2b-ae09-49f3-a574-23dc635f26bf&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;area S17&lt;/a&gt;) carries a master key that locks or unlocks all chests in Salsvault.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultDoorsAndWalls&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;adbe8b05-4b63-4438-99a4-31e49e2e46c4&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultDoorsAndWalls&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;65231e1e-9207-4563-8802-d53f19ca1aa0&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Doors and Walls&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;ca29897d-2246-4413-af09-4dac4429cadb&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Salsvault’s heavy doors are made of black stone, and its walls are made of blue stone. A&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover spell-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-detect-magic&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(112, 76, 217); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;detect magic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;spell reveals a faint aura of abjuration magic radiating from the doors and walls. Each door and each 10-foot section of wall has AC 17; 27 hit points; resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage; and immunity to poison and psychic damage.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;4a2b9c08-ced9-4628-9c04-fe490acf5fc7&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;If an area’s description notes a locked door, the lock can be picked with a successful DC 15 Dexterity check using thieves’ tools, or the door can be forced open with a successful DC 18 Strength check.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-ferol-sal&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(188, 15, 15); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;Ferol Sal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#S17FerolsLaboratory&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;05a5f9b8-1779-4118-bf71-1ddc06df79cc&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;area S17&lt;/a&gt;) carries a master key that locks or unlocks all the doors in Salsvault.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;AeorianRobes&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;f39d8245-b33e-4ad0-a361-398730de09c0&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#AeorianRobes&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;50f5b039-aea2-4856-b872-48d74e201716&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Aeorian Robes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;88d920ed-962a-432e-bb06-7cda8ff01fd6&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;The undead in the complex wear archaic-looking robes. With a successful DC 12 Intelligence (&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover skill-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/free-rules/playing-the-game#Skills&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/skills/7-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(17, 136, 76); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;History&lt;/a&gt;) check, a character recognizes the robes as being of Aeorian style. The characters can also find intact robes of the same style in the complex. Constructs and zombies in the complex don’t attack a character wearing intact robes, unless the character attacks first.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;EasternSlope&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;9d2d03b4-ac48-4246-add8-ab220da0f6b9&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#EasternSlope&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8a844f86-d16a-4fd1-9da0-66b3f56e7152&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Eastern Slope&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;76d1d01a-cd01-4b37-b7bb-2504604b0a66&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Salsvault is tilted in the ice, with its east side lower than its west side. Every area within the complex features a gentle slope downward to the east.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultLight&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;45aceab1-2ddc-4f5e-b3d6-db14190c0dcf&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultLight&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b9b57582-abfa-46f3-b1d0-78b4d0c97701&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Light&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;7a450c46-cb37-4f46-99a2-bb09ad2432d8&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Unless otherwise noted, wall sconces with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover spell-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2048-continual-flame&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2048-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(112, 76, 217); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;continual flame&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;spells cast on them brightly light the interior of Salsvault.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultTemperature&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;3b3d5241-dd0c-4ebb-a232-c17be7513efc&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultTemperature&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8de5800f-8cde-44f2-add6-e1c6b93756f1&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Temperature&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;ea1273f0-b367-47a2-af39-f0f85ad791a2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Though Salsvault’s interior is guarded from wind and snow, the temperatures within the structure are still well below freezing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultWater&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e0ae451b-1545-48ac-84f9-e535c88146f7&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultWater&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;7b28e01b-5857-458d-bf81-7758f1737f42&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Water&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;16c4468b-7896-403b-af1c-518c10650143&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Some areas of Salsvault are partially filled with seawater flowing in from beneath the ice of Thin Sheets. A creature that starts its turn in the frigid water must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or gain one level of&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover condition-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/free-rules/rules-glossary#ExhaustionCondition&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/conditions/4-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(17, 136, 76); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;exhaustion&lt;/a&gt;. Creatures that lair within the water in the complex are immune to this effect.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;DenizensofSalsvault&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;35f6a7c8-7d46-479e-b566-99d1d3ab2755&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); clear: both; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#DenizensofSalsvault&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;80c33f20-0e81-4b04-bb08-b01149506223&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Denizens of Salsvault&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;81d48d02-07d9-4bf5-87ef-7f86757103ae&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Many of the creatures the characters can encounter in Salsvault have similar characteristics and tactics.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;Beasts&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e2694d24-24b7-434d-8563-5391c9f84b60&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#Beasts&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8d39ff8f-480d-4bc9-ae6b-7d3d7032469e&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Beasts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;90d35aec-a795-47c7-94af-7d6e0fac6e82&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Several sea creatures haunt the submerged areas of the complex. These beasts attack characters who enter the water, fighting until reduced to half their hit points or fewer before fleeing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;Constructs&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;942e304b-13c3-46fc-9f35-0be455f55cf1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#Constructs&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;9f8a6aa6-eaec-4a18-949a-a09bdfbd243c&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Constructs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;740f70fd-e811-4fab-a69b-f4c2ba85cbbb&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;When Salsvault crashed into Foren, a number of its construct guardians survived. Those constructs continue to guard the complex, fighting intruders until they flee Salsvault. The constructs won’t leave the complex willingly and won’t pursue characters who do so. The constructs don’t attack the undead of Salsvault, understanding on some level that those undead are the remains of the people who created them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;Undead&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;25de6990-a04c-4740-b751-c19cae0341fb&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#Undead&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;a7dd2d95-66dc-435d-a355-b3c87a8dcfaa&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Undead&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;d7d14a7c-a6c0-40ca-8800-c8d5580a986a&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;The humanoids working in Salsvault died when it crashed into Foren. Just before impact,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-ferol-sal&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(188, 15, 15); font-weight: bold !important;&quot;&gt;Ferol Sal&lt;/a&gt;, the necromancer in charge of Salsvault, released an experimental disease that caused any humanoids who died in the complex to return as undead. Most of those affected returned as zombies that attack intruders on sight and fight to the death. Ferol returned as a wight and has continued to work obsessively in his personal lab (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#S17FerolsLaboratory&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b703dc2f-dcd1-4abb-a04b-87edee373458&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;area S17&lt;/a&gt;) ever since. Because of the cold here, all the undead are relatively well preserved.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultCeilings&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;1f7f5513-917c-4f96-b18f-0bd34ae0a73e&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Ceilings&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;a0db08a3-351f-4fec-a5d7-97061e04c03c&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The ceilings in Salsvault’s rooms are 10 feet high, with 8-foot-high doorways connecting them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultChests&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;86f954ef-65cf-4f2e-9d5d-953533cef70f&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultChests&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;f99c74fb-ecda-497c-b639-1a43c410b190&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Chests&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;ca100999-e9d8-471c-a58a-de0926f12934&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Stone chests two feet on each side are built into the floors in several areas. A&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover spell-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-detect-magic&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(112, 76, 217) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;detect magic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;spell reveals a faint aura of abjuration magic radiating from each chest. A chest has AC 17; 27 hit points; resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage; and immunity to poison and psychic damage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;50691097-6502-42bc-962d-445e05e7f733&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;If an area’s description notes a locked chest, the chest’s lock can be picked with a successful DC 15 Dexterity check using thieves’ tools or forced open with a successful DC 18 Strength check.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-ferol-sal&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;Ferol Sal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#S17FerolsLaboratory&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;5c809e2b-ae09-49f3-a574-23dc635f26bf&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;area S17&lt;/a&gt;) carries a master key that locks or unlocks all chests in Salsvault.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultDoorsAndWalls&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;adbe8b05-4b63-4438-99a4-31e49e2e46c4&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultDoorsAndWalls&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;65231e1e-9207-4563-8802-d53f19ca1aa0&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Doors and Walls&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;ca29897d-2246-4413-af09-4dac4429cadb&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Salsvault’s heavy doors are made of black stone, and its walls are made of blue stone. A&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover spell-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-detect-magic&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2065-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(112, 76, 217) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;detect magic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;spell reveals a faint aura of abjuration magic radiating from the doors and walls. Each door and each 10-foot section of wall has AC 17; 27 hit points; resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage; and immunity to poison and psychic damage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;4a2b9c08-ced9-4628-9c04-fe490acf5fc7&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;If an area’s description notes a locked door, the lock can be picked with a successful DC 15 Dexterity check using thieves’ tools, or the door can be forced open with a successful DC 18 Strength check.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-ferol-sal&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;Ferol Sal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#S17FerolsLaboratory&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;05a5f9b8-1779-4118-bf71-1ddc06df79cc&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;area S17&lt;/a&gt;) carries a master key that locks or unlocks all the doors in Salsvault.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;AeorianRobes&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;f39d8245-b33e-4ad0-a361-398730de09c0&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#AeorianRobes&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;50f5b039-aea2-4856-b872-48d74e201716&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Aeorian Robes&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;88d920ed-962a-432e-bb06-7cda8ff01fd6&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The undead in the complex wear archaic-looking robes. With a successful DC 12 Intelligence (&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover skill-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/free-rules/playing-the-game#Skills&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/skills/7-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(17, 136, 76) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;History&lt;/a&gt;) check, a character recognizes the robes as being of Aeorian style. The characters can also find intact robes of the same style in the complex. Constructs and zombies in the complex don’t attack a character wearing intact robes, unless the character attacks first.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;EasternSlope&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;9d2d03b4-ac48-4246-add8-ab220da0f6b9&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#EasternSlope&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8a844f86-d16a-4fd1-9da0-66b3f56e7152&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Eastern Slope&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;76d1d01a-cd01-4b37-b7bb-2504604b0a66&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Salsvault is tilted in the ice, with its east side lower than its west side. Every area within the complex features a gentle slope downward to the east.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultLight&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;45aceab1-2ddc-4f5e-b3d6-db14190c0dcf&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultLight&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b9b57582-abfa-46f3-b1d0-78b4d0c97701&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Light&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;7a450c46-cb37-4f46-99a2-bb09ad2432d8&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Unless otherwise noted, wall sconces with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover spell-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2048-continual-flame&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2048-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(112, 76, 217) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;continual flame&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;spells cast on them brightly light the interior of Salsvault.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultTemperature&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;3b3d5241-dd0c-4ebb-a232-c17be7513efc&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultTemperature&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8de5800f-8cde-44f2-add6-e1c6b93756f1&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Temperature&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;ea1273f0-b367-47a2-af39-f0f85ad791a2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Though Salsvault’s interior is guarded from wind and snow, the temperatures within the structure are still well below freezing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;SalsvaultWater&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e0ae451b-1545-48ac-84f9-e535c88146f7&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultWater&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;7b28e01b-5857-458d-bf81-7758f1737f42&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Water&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;16c4468b-7896-403b-af1c-518c10650143&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Some areas of Salsvault are partially filled with seawater flowing in from beneath the ice of Thin Sheets. A creature that starts its turn in the frigid water must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or gain one level of&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover condition-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/free-rules/rules-glossary#ExhaustionCondition&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/conditions/4-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(17, 136, 76) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;exhaustion&lt;/a&gt;. Creatures that lair within the water in the complex are immune to this effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;DenizensofSalsvault&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;35f6a7c8-7d46-479e-b566-99d1d3ab2755&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); clear: both; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#DenizensofSalsvault&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;80c33f20-0e81-4b04-bb08-b01149506223&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Denizens of Salsvault&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;81d48d02-07d9-4bf5-87ef-7f86757103ae&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Many of the creatures the characters can encounter in Salsvault have similar characteristics and tactics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;Beasts&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e2694d24-24b7-434d-8563-5391c9f84b60&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#Beasts&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;8d39ff8f-480d-4bc9-ae6b-7d3d7032469e&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Beasts&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;90d35aec-a795-47c7-94af-7d6e0fac6e82&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Several sea creatures haunt the submerged areas of the complex. These beasts attack characters who enter the water, fighting until reduced to half their hit points or fewer before fleeing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;Constructs&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;942e304b-13c3-46fc-9f35-0be455f55cf1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#Constructs&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;9f8a6aa6-eaec-4a18-949a-a09bdfbd243c&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Constructs&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;740f70fd-e811-4fab-a69b-f4c2ba85cbbb&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;When Salsvault crashed into Foren, a number of its construct guardians survived. Those constructs continue to guard the complex, fighting intruders until they flee Salsvault. The constructs won’t leave the complex willingly and won’t pursue characters who do so. The constructs don’t attack the undead of Salsvault, understanding on some level that those undead are the remains of the people who created them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;Undead&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;25de6990-a04c-4740-b751-c19cae0341fb&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#Undead&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;a7dd2d95-66dc-435d-a355-b3c87a8dcfaa&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Undead&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;d7d14a7c-a6c0-40ca-8800-c8d5580a986a&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The humanoids working in Salsvault died when it crashed into Foren. Just before impact,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-ferol-sal&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744310-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;Ferol Sal&lt;/a&gt;, the necromancer in charge of Salsvault, released an experimental disease that caused any humanoids who died in the complex to return as undead. Most of those affected returned as zombies that attack intruders on sight and fight to the death. Ferol returned as a wight and has continued to work obsessively in his personal lab (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#S17FerolsLaboratory&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b703dc2f-dcd1-4abb-a04b-87edee373458&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;area S17&lt;/a&gt;) ever since. Because of the cold here, all the undead are relatively well preserved.&lt;/p&gt;" id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-47">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1460" width="730" x="570" y="7500" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-48" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="2750" y="7550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-49" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Steinerne Tische liegen am östlichen Ende des Raumes in Trümmern auf dem Boden. An der Westwand stehen zwei offene Steinkisten. Eine Schicht aus feinem Sand bedeckt das Innere der Kisten sowie den Boden um sie herum&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="560" x="2940" y="7620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-50" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Lärm-Warnung:&lt;/b&gt; Wie im vorherigen Raum gilt auch hier: Jedes Geräusch, das lauter als ein Flüstern ist, alarmiert die &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;116&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;belebten Rüstungen&lt;/b&gt; in Raum S3, die daraufhin den Raum untersuchen.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Steinkisten:&lt;/b&gt; Bei genauerer Betrachtung wird klar, dass die Kisten fest im Boden verankert (eingebaut) sind und nicht bewegt werden können.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Spurenanalyse (DC 12 Weisheit/Wahrnehmung):&lt;/b&gt; Wer den Sand auf dem Boden untersucht, findet folgende Fährten:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Zwei Paar Zwergenstiefel-Abdrücke:&lt;/b&gt; Diese stammen von Orvo und Urgon.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Zwei Paar menschengroße Stiefel-Abdrücke:&lt;/b&gt; Diese wirken unnatürlich gleichmäßig und stammen von den &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;99&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;belebten Rüstungen&lt;/b&gt; aus Raum S3.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="560" x="2940" y="7730" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-51" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="3630" y="7550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-52" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;In dieser Kammer liegen verrostete Plattenpanzer-Teile inmitten der Trümmer zerstörter Steinmöbel verstreut. Ein im Boden eingelassener Amboss steht vor einem kalten Schmelzofen im Südwesten. Auf der gegenüberliegenden Seite des Ofens ragen zwei humanoide Füße aus einem Schutthaufen hervor&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="3791" y="7610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-53" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;Normalerweise halten zwei &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;27&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;belebte Rüstungen (animated armors)&lt;/b&gt; in dieser Kammer Wache. Falls die Rüstungen den Raum nicht verlassen haben, um Störungen in den Bereichen S1 oder S2 zu untersuchen, befinden sich beide Anzüge hier, wenn die Charaktere eintreffen. In diesem Fall kannst du Folgendes hinzufügen:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;Zwei vollständige Stahlrüstungen stehen aufrecht, aber leer in der Mitte der Kammer. Ihre glänzenden Oberflächen bilden einen krassen Kontrast zu den rostigen Teilen, die in der Nähe verstreut liegen.“&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="560" x="3780" y="7760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-54" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Die &quot;Rettungsmission&quot; &amp;amp; der Schatz&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der &quot;Überlebende&quot;:&lt;/b&gt; Bei den Füßen, die aus dem Schutt ragen, handelt es sich um einen ehemaligen Schmied von Aeor. Er wurde beim Absturz der Stadt von einem Steintisch zerschmettert.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Zustand:&lt;/b&gt; Er ist mittlerweile ein &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;Zombie&lt;/b&gt;, steckt aber unter den Trümmern fest und ist &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;85&quot;&gt;festgesetzt (restrained)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wahrnehmung (DC 12 Weisheit/Wahrnehmung):&lt;/b&gt; Wer die Füße genau beobachtet, bemerkt, dass sie leicht zucken.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Befreiung:&lt;/b&gt; * Ein Charakter benötigt &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;36&quot;&gt;10 Minuten&lt;/b&gt;, um den Schutt wegzuräumen.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Mehrere Charaktere verkürzen die Zeit entsprechend (z. B. 2 Personen = 5 Minuten).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Achtung:&lt;/b&gt; Sobald der Zombie befreit ist, greift er sofort an!&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Beute (Treasure):&lt;/b&gt; Der Zombie trägt eine Schürze, in der sich ein beschädigtes &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;78&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Schmiedewerkzeug aus Mithral&lt;/b&gt; befindet (Wert: &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;123&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;50 GP&lt;/b&gt;).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="340" width="560" x="3760" y="7990" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-55" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="4440" y="7550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-56" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;„Zertrümmerte Steintische liegen in diesem Raum verstreut auf dem Boden. Zwei im Boden eingelassene Steinkisten stehen nebeneinander an der gegenüberliegenden Wand. In die Tür im Westen sind Worte in drachischen Runen eingraviert. An der Wand neben der Tür befindet sich ein großer Eisenhebel, der in der oberen Position steht.“&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="4600" y="7610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-57" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;1. Die Warnung&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inschrift (Draconisch):&lt;/b&gt; „Krankheitslager. Nur autorisiertes Personal.“&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;2. Die Steinkisten (Fallen &amp;amp; Inhalt)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Falle:&lt;/b&gt; Wer versucht, das Schloss zu knacken oder die Kiste gewaltsam zu öffnen und scheitert, wird von einem &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;109&quot;&gt;Kältestrahl&lt;/b&gt; getroffen (+4 Trefferbonus, &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;149&quot;&gt;1d8 Kälteschaden&lt;/b&gt;).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Entschärfen:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Entdeckung (DC 13 Wahrnehmung):&lt;/b&gt; Man findet das winzige Wort für „Eis“ an den Scharnieren.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analyse (DC 10 Arkana):&lt;/b&gt; Man erkennt, dass das Wort die Falle steuert. Das Zerkratzen des Wortes deaktiviert die Falle.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inhalt:&lt;/b&gt; Jede Kiste enthält im Sand eingebettet &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;47&quot;&gt;zwei Phiolen Frostleid (Frigid Woe)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;3. Der Eisenhebel&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Funktion:&lt;/b&gt; Wenn der Hebel nach &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;unten&lt;/b&gt; gezogen wird, schießen in Raum S5 Flammen von der Decke (man hört ein Zischen). Hebel &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;122&quot;&gt;oben&lt;/b&gt; schaltet die Flammen aus.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hinweis (DC 13 Wahrnehmung):&lt;/b&gt; Man sieht verblasste rote Farbe am Hebel (ein Warnsignal).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;4. Die Türen &amp;amp; Die Teleport-Falle&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Zustand:&lt;/b&gt; Die Türen zu S1 und S5 sind verschlossen.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die S5-Falle:&lt;/b&gt; Die Tür nach S5 ist magisch geschützt (Beschwörungsmagie).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Effekt:&lt;/b&gt; Bei einem Fehlversuch, die Tür zu öffnen oder zu knacken, wird die Person sofort in den &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;96&quot;&gt;Raum S15 teleportiert&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Entschärfen:&lt;/b&gt; Suche nach dem Wort für „Verschwinden“ (DC 13 Nachforschung) und zerkratze es (DC 10 Arkana notwendig, um den Zusammenhang zu verstehen).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="610" width="560" x="4590" y="7760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-58" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1780" y="8520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-59" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Eine Hitzewelle trifft euch, ausgehend von einer Wand aus wirbelnden Flammen, die diesen Bereich ausfüllen und von der Decke herabschießen" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="560" x="1960" y="8580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-60" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="In diesem Raum sind lediglich acht Steinkisten zu sehen, die entlang der gegenüberliegenden Wand fest in den Boden eingebaut sind" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="560" x="1950" y="8680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-61" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Zustand: AKTIV (Flammen an)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Gefahr:&lt;/b&gt; Der Raum ist mit herabschießenden Flammen gefüllt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mechanik:&lt;/b&gt; Jede Kreatur, die den Bereich betritt oder ihren Zug dort beginnt, muss einen &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;88&quot;&gt;DC 12 Geschicklichkeitsrettungswurf&lt;/b&gt; ablegen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Schaden:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;4 (1d8) Feuerschaden&lt;/b&gt; bei einem Fehlschlag (halber Schaden bei Erfolg).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Zustand: INAKTIV (Flammen aus)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hinweise (DC 13 Wahrnehmung):&lt;/b&gt; Ein Charakter bemerkt einen schwachen, öligen Geruch im Raum.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Entdeckung:&lt;/b&gt; Bei genauer Untersuchung der Decke fallen winzige, nadelstichgroße Löcher auf (aus denen das brennbare Öl/Gas austritt).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die 8 Steinkisten (Lagerraum S6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sicherung:&lt;/b&gt; Alle Kisten sind verschlossen (DC 15 mit Diebeswerkzeug oder Gewalt).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inhalt:&lt;/b&gt; Jede der acht Kisten ist mit feinem Sand gefüllt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Beute:&lt;/b&gt; In jeder Kiste liegen &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;drei Phiolen Frostleid (Frigid Woe)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Insgesamt befinden sich hier also 24 Phiolen – genug, um eine ganze Stadt zu infizieren.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="450" width="560" x="1940" y="8750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-62" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="Inactive" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="1940" y="8640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-63" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="2680" y="8510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;Three human&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-zombie&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);&quot;&gt;zombies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;in tattered Aeorian robes roam this hall aimlessly and attack intruders on sight.&lt;/span&gt;" link="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;Three human&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-zombie&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);&quot;&gt;zombies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;in tattered Aeorian robes roam this hall aimlessly and attack intruders on sight.&lt;/span&gt;" id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-64">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="60" width="560" x="2810" y="8600" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-65" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="2680" y="8740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-66" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(241, 228, 200); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;Four unmade beds are built into the east and west walls here, each with a footlocker tucked beneath it.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="560" x="2850" y="8760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;One of the footlockers holds an intact Aeorian robe (see “&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultFeatures&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b08f0f7e-7bd5-4b7e-ad1c-fc435a83f0c4&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);&quot;&gt;Salsvault Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;” at the beginning of this section).&lt;/span&gt;" link="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;One of the footlockers holds an intact Aeorian robe (see “&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultFeatures&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b08f0f7e-7bd5-4b7e-ad1c-fc435a83f0c4&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);&quot;&gt;Salsvault Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;” at the beginning of this section).&lt;/span&gt;" id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-67">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="60" width="560" x="2850" y="8850" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-68" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="„Trümmer von zerstörten Steinmöbeln bedecken den Boden. Die Wände hier sind rissig, als hätten sie einst fest eingebaute Regale getragen, die nun nur noch Schutt sind.“" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="560" x="3691" y="8630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-69" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S8" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="3500" y="8500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-70" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;Salsvault’s crash into Foren destroyed the magic torches in this room, leaving it shrouded in darkness. When the characters can see into this area, read:&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="3691" y="8540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-71" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;1. Gelände und Gefahren&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Schwieriges Gelände:&lt;/b&gt; Der Boden ist so stark mit Trümmern bedeckt, dass er als &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;78&quot;&gt;difficult terrain&lt;/i&gt; zählt (Bewegung kostet die doppelte Menge an Fuß).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Versteckte Gefahr:&lt;/b&gt; Unter dem Schutt verbirgt sich ein &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;54&quot;&gt;Würgeteppich (Rug of Smothering)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Entdeckung:&lt;/b&gt; Charaktere mit einer &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;passiven Wahrnehmung von 12 oder höher&lt;/b&gt; bemerken den Teppich zwar, erkennen aber nicht, dass er magisch belebt ist und angreifen wird.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;2. Fundstücke&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Suche:&lt;/b&gt; Wer den Schutt gründlich durchsucht (erfordert einen &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;60&quot;&gt;DC 14 Weisheit/Wahrnehmung Check&lt;/b&gt;), kann einen wertvollen Gegenstand finden.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Beute:&lt;/b&gt; Eine intakte &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Aeorische Robe&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hinweis:&lt;/i&gt; Diese Roben sind oft magisch oder dienten früher als Statussymbol/Uniform für die Forscher von Aeor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="560" x="3710" y="8720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-72" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S9" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="4490" y="8530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-73" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Unter vier Betten, die an der Nord- und Südwand befestigt sind, stehen Truhen. In der Mitte des Raumes schlurfen vier Zombies in zerlumpten Roben umher und stoßen dabei leise und teilnahmslos gegeneinander." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="560" x="4650" y="8610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;a45320d6-f53d-4218-8e56-d0483734f130&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The four&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-zombie&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;zombies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;attack as soon as they see intruders. The footlockers are empty.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;" link="&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;a45320d6-f53d-4218-8e56-d0483734f130&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The four&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-zombie&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/17077-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;zombies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;attack as soon as they see intruders. The footlockers are empty.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;" id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-74">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="70" width="560" x="4650" y="8680" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-75" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1784" y="9230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-76" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Dieser Raum befindet sich in einem makellosen Zustand und wurde offenbar nach der Zerstörung, die man sonst überall im Komplex sieht, aufgeräumt. Ein ordentlich gemachtes Bett steht in der Mitte der Westwand, flankiert von kleinen Tischen auf beiden Seiten. Der Raum enthält zudem einen steinernen Schreibtisch mit dazugehörigem Stuhl sowie eine im Boden eingelassene Truhe.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="1956" y="9307" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-77" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;1. Zustand&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Obwohl der untote &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;Ferol Sal&lt;/b&gt; hier nicht mehr schläft, haben er und seine Zombies seinen persönlichen Wohnbereich nach dem Absturz von Aeor akribisch aufgeräumt und instand gesetzt.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;2. Die Truhe (Falle &amp;amp; Inhalt)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wächter:&lt;/b&gt; In der Truhe verbirgt sich ein &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;40&quot;&gt;Schwarm untoter Schlangen&lt;/b&gt;, der jeden angreift, der die Truhe öffnet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Besonderheiten des Schwarms:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Gilt als &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Untot&lt;/b&gt; (benötigt keine Luft, Nahrung, Schlaf).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Immunität&lt;/b&gt; gegen Giftschaden und den Zustand &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot;&gt;vergiftet&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inhalt:&lt;/b&gt; Neben dem Schwarm befindet sich hier Ferols persönlicher Schatz.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;3. Der Schreibtisch (Hinweise)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Funde:&lt;/b&gt; Ein eingetrocknetes Tintenfass, benutzte Federkiele, fünf leere Pergamentbögen und eine verblasste Nachricht.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Nachricht (Draconisch):&lt;/b&gt; Es dauert ein paar Minuten, um die archaischen Runen zu entziffern (oder per &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;105&quot;&gt;Comprehend Languages&lt;/i&gt;).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Inhalt der Notiz:&lt;/b&gt; (Der Text der Notiz folgt im Abenteuer direkt nach diesem Abschnitt).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="450" width="560" x="1950" y="9470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-78" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h4 id=&quot;FerolSalsChamberTreasure&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;9303d6e2-a50b-4b04-aa1a-cc3f98736abe&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Treasure&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;39b2f279-0c11-4568-a07b-2ce3112d33a8&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The chest contains 1,006 sp, 45 ep, and 201 gp in Aeorian coinage.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="560" x="1800" y="10030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-79" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;An wen auch immer dies finden mag:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;All meine Leute sind tot: meine Familie, meine Freunde und meine Arbeiter. Auch ich bin tot. Wäre es nicht um mein schnelles Handeln und mein Geschick in der Nekromantie geschehen, wäre unsere wichtige Arbeit in Salsvault beendet. Ich arbeite in meiner untoten Gestalt weiter und versuche, eine Krankheit zu finden, die die Götter selbst infizieren kann. Sollte ich vergangen sein, so flehe ich dich an: Finde mein Labor, finde meine Aufzeichnungen und bringe mein Werk zu Ende. Die Götter müssen für die Zerstörung Aeors bezahlen.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;— Ferol Sal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="560" x="1950" y="10160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-80" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="S11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="2680" y="9210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-81" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;Salsvault’s crash into Foren destroyed the magic torches in this room, leaving it shrouded in darkness. When the characters can see into this area, read:&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="2850" y="9280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bB0-X0oldWWfwmH7fZuz-82" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(241, 228, 200); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;Iron pots, pans, utensils, and frost-covered food covers the floor of this kitchen. A steel stove is built into the west wall.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="560" x="2850" y="9380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e68a8b38-cdf2-4dfd-b4fe-4a8e85efeda5&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;When the characters enter the room, four&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744300-animated-knife&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744300-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;animated kitchen knives&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;fly up from the floor and attack. The knives are&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/16865-flying-sword&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/16865-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;flying swords&lt;/a&gt;, with these changes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b26da6ab-3066-4850-ba94-4bdf05228b1b&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing