and produce cover the floor, all well rimed and inedible.&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e68a8b38-cdf2-4dfd-b4fe-4a8e85efeda5&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;When the characters enter the room, four&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744300-animated-knife&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/744300-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;animated kitchen knives&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;fly up from the floor and attack. The knives are&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover monster-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/16865-flying-sword&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/monsters/16865-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(188, 15, 15) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;flying swords&lt;/a&gt;, with these changes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-content-chunk-id=&quot;b26da6ab-3066-4850-ba94-4bdf05228b1b&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; list-style: initial; margin: 0px 0px 0px 19.5px; padding: 15px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-content-chunk-id=&quot;0f73e334-9497-4a7d-9e33-0d2876dfec8e&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px;&quot;&gt;Each knife is a Tiny construct with 12 (5d4) hit points and a challenge rating of 1/8 (25 XP).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-content-chunk-id=&quot;df3b7011-b84e-4d68-888d-c559bf9e37f1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px;&quot;&gt;Instead of a longsword attack, each knife makes a melee attack (+4 to hit) that deals 3 (1d4 + 1) piercing damage on a hit.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e4c8a783-bf44-44e2-939a-6cb11a73451a&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: in